{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Reaching an Agreement"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Talking about the Party"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le14ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Dealing with Communication Breakdown"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Sometimes you don't understand what was said or something was not clear to you. It is, therefore, important to seek clarification from the person you are talking to. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>Use a tag question<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">You're</span> happy with getting a raise, <span class=\"underline\">aren't you?</span></span></li><br/><li>Use the phrases <span class=\"italic\">\u201cdo you mean ... \u201d</span>, <span class=\"italic\">\u201care you saying ... \u201d</span>, <span class=\"italic\">\u201cdoes that mean ... \u201d</span> and the information you need clarification on.<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">Are you saying</span> we avoided bad press and helped Farmani rebrand?<br/><span class=\"underline\">Does that mean</span> I can get a new office with a window?<br/><span class=\"underline\">Do you mean</span> to say that we've actually helped them?</span></li><br/><li>Use the conjunction \u201cor\u201d followed by the clarification you need to make.<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">Or</span> is this just a bonus for all the work I've done?</span></ul>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Giving Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Conversations are far more interesting when people interact during the conversation. It is important to ask for others' opinions on a subject as well as giving your own. Here are some ways you can give opinions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>clause +, <span class=\"italic\">if you ask me.</span> </li><li><span class=\"italic\">Personally</span>, + clause.  </li><li><span class=\"italic\">I think</span> + clause.  </li><li><span class=\"italic\">I'd say</span> + clause.  </li><li><span class=\"italic\">I say</span> + clause. </li><li><span class=\"italic\">I strongly believe</span> + clause.  </li><ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The party was amazing, <span class=\"underline\">if you ask me.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">Personally</span>, I think it was a good idea to have both events happening at the same time."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">I'd say</span> this helped the company connect with a new audience. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">I say</span> we contact him and get his assessment."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">I strongly believe</span> people will be talking about this on the internet. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reluctant"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not willing to do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was very reluctant about this event at first."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about things that happened at an event. "}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "leak"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an occasion when private or secret information is told to the press"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It helped us divert attention from the leak. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob11aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bad press"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "criticism that appears in the news"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We need to avoid bad press. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob11aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to rebrand"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to change the corporate image of a company "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We avoided bad press and helped the company rebrand. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob11aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to direct attention to"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to focus someone's concern on something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We helped direct attention to their new clothing line."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob11aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to connect with"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make someone understand something and have the same ideas and opinions"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We helped him connect with a new audience."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob11aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to guarantee"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to promise something will happen"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can guarantee I have made the right decision. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob11aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to have charisma"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to posses a strong personal quality that makes other people like you"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You do have charisma, Miranda."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob11aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "intention"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a plan in your mind to do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My intention is to contact him and get some feedback."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob11aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write three to five questions related to an office event held recently. (For example, did you like the party? Why?)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go around the office or your room and ask questions. Make sure you record their answers."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask people to elaborate on their answers. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask for clarification when you do not understand a response. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compile the results of your survey and share them with your colleagues.  "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write questions about an office event."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask questions and record answers."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask people for their opinions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask for clarification when I don't understand something. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about my answers with friends. "}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can give opinions."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about jobs and work."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can ask for clarification."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " How do you usually feel after attending an event?"}, {"type"