wo have guaranteed that I've made the right decision. You have charisma, Miranda.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Does that mean I get a new office? Or is it just a bonus?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Ok, let's backtrack. I don't think a new office is necessary. However, you are happy with a raise, aren't you? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Of course! Thank you Janet."}, {"time": "53000", "image": "engenn7le14ob11re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I guess it's time to discuss what we're doing next. What's on your agenda?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: My intention is to contact Ferdinand and get his feedback.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I'd say that sounds appropriate.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I strongly believe that there will be lots of activity about the events online. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Perhaps. That video of you went viral.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Real funny, Janet. Anyways, I'm expecting to hear from Ferdinand soon.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Sounds to me like you're on top of things like usual. Keep me in the loop."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}